==Battleground==
*1 [[Large White Ball]] (12,000%) spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Large White Ball]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Large Iron Ball]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**10 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn, delay 8.33~11.67 seconds<sup>250f~350f</sup>.
**12 [[Large White Ball]]s (12,000%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is not a free stage. The large amount of balls can overwhelm early-midgame players easily. The use of many meatshields is recommended, while long ranged units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] slowly whittle down the enemies. As for the Metal Balls, it is best to use ranged critical hitters such as [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]] or [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress]], as the likes of [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion]] will hardly do anything.

4 crown is annoying, but is doable with such lineups: [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Lord of Ruin Jagando Jr.]] (30), [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]] (37), [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] (30), [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] (45), [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] (40), [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]] (30), [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] (50), [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] (45), [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] (45), [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]] (40). Lower levels might work. Rich cat and Sniper the Cat are required. First kill the White Ball and Red Ball with Courier and a few meatshields, let the Courier be killed by the Metal Ball. Then stall the Metal Ball by Modern Cat with help from Sniper the Cat (without knockbacks, the Metal Ball will gradually push forward and ruin the stack). Stack at least 2 Jagando, 1 Ururun and 1 Mina during this period, and once the Metal Ball is dead, spawn all units (send courier a bit later to prevent early hit of the enemy base). Jagando's surge is the key to prevent the waves of White and Red Balls from pushing forward. Curry Cat's slow can stop the Metal Balls from pushing. Jiangshi and L'il King Dragon make the Attack-up combo. The stack of Paris and Courier provides the main damage force. It may take a few attempts, but if well timed Jagando can survive until the last 1-2 Balls, and you will win eventually with cheap units.

